  "question": {
    "text": "<p>The wavelength of electrons accelerated from rest through a potential difference of <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>40</mn><mi>kV</mi></math> is&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">X</mi><mo>&#215;</mo><msup><mn>10</mn><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>12</mn></mrow></msup><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi><mo>.</mo></math>&nbsp;The value of&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi></math>&nbsp;is. (Nearest integer)</p><p>Given: Mass of electron <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>=</mo><mn>9</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>&#215;</mo><msup><mn>10</mn><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>31</mn></mrow></msup><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>kg</mi></math></p><p>Charge on an electron <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>6</mn><mo>&#215;</mo><msup><mn>10</mn><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>19</mn></mrow></msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">C</mi></math></p><p>Planck&#39;s constant <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>=</mo><mn>6</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>63</mn><mo>&#215;</mo><msup><mn>10</mn><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>34</mn></mrow></msup><mi>Js</mi></math></p>",
    "image": null
  },
  "options": [],
  "correctValue": "6",
  "solution": {
    "text": "<p>De-broglie-wave length of electron:</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#955;</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">e</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">h</mi><msqrt><mn>2</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi><mo>(</mo><mi>KE</mi><mo>)</mo></msqrt></mfrac><mfenced open=\"{\" close=\"\"><mtable columnalign=\"left\"><mtr><mtd><mo>&#8757;</mo><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">e</mi><mo>-</mo></msup><mtext>is accelerated&#160;</mtext></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd><mtext>&#160;from rest&#160;</mtext></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>KE</mi><mo>=</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">q</mi><mo>&#215;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">V</mi></mtd></mtr></mtable></mfenced></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#955;</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">h</mi><msqrt><mn>2</mn><mi>mqv</mi></msqrt></mfrac></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>6</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>63</mn><mo>&#215;</mo><msup><mn>10</mn><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>34</mn></mrow></msup></mrow><msqrt><mn>2</mn><mo>&#215;</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>6</mn><mo>&#215;</mo><msup><mn>10</mn><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>19</mn></mrow></msup><mo>&#215;</mo><mn>9</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>&#215;</mo><msup><mn>10</mn><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>31</mn></mrow></msup><mo>&#215;</mo><mn>40</mn><mo>&#215;</mo><msup><mn>10</mn><mn>3</mn></msup></msqrt></mfrac></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>614</mn><mo>&#215;</mo><msup><mn>10</mn><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>11</mn></mrow></msup><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>=</mo><mn>6</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>14</mn><mo>&#215;</mo><msup><mn>10</mn><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>12</mn></mrow></msup><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi></math></p><p>Nearest integer <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>=</mo><mn>6</mn></math></p><p>OR</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#955;</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>12</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>3</mn></mrow><msqrt><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">V</mi></msqrt></mfrac><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#197;</mi></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>12</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>3</mn></mrow><mn>200</mn></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mn>6</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>15</mn><mo>&#215;</mo><msup><mn>10</mn><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>12</mn></mrow></msup><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi></math></p><p>Ans. is&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>6</mn></math></p>",
